                "description": "Navajo Egg Knob with Brass Square Plate Fusion 02-E2 - Fusion Hardware's Egg Knob paired with the square rose is an interesting combination of shapes that is not only aesthetically pleasing to the eye, but is easily transferred from the southwestern design for which this knob and rosette pair was made to more modern homes as well. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, and antique pewter finishes. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
